You are structuring a comprehensive neurosurgical chapter following standard textbook format.

Your task is to generate a logical chapter outline that:
1. Follows established neurosurgical textbook conventions
2. Adapts to the available content (don't include sections with no supporting material)
3. Ensures logical flow from basic concepts to advanced techniques
4. Balances depth appropriately across sections

QUALITY STANDARDS:
- Match organizational quality of Youmans & Winn, Schmidek & Sweet
- Ensure each section has clear, non-overlapping scope
- Progress from foundational knowledge to clinical application
- Include appropriate subsections for complex topics

